{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/2281","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:28.409173+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"Thanks for the report!\r\n\r\nI agree, I think we should probably always cast inputs into `map_coordinates` into a float dtype before doing computation. Any interest in putting together a PR? :)","created_at":"2020-02-21T18:48:13Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/2281#issuecomment-589784094","id":589784094,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/2281","minimized":null,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU4OTc4NDA5NA==","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/589784094/reactions"},"updated_at":"2020-02-21T18:48:13Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/589784094","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1217238?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoyer","id":1217238,"login":"shoyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTcyMzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyer","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"This appears to have been fixed now.","created_at":"2022-06-24T18:59:47Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/2281#issuecomment-1165850340","id":1165850340,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/2281","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc5FfXbk","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1165850340/reactions"},"updated_at":"2022-06-24T18:59:47Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1165850340","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"NONE","body":"Resampling an int8 image of size over 256 such as this one\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1614505/75037647-92aada00-54ac-11ea-86cf-0cc07ba16304.png)\r\nwith coordinates in floating points (random perturbation) leadis to wrap around issues most likely related to internal casting of the coordinates into int8:\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1614505/75037714-b66e2000-54ac-11ea-8db0-50f2b0f2e283.png)\r\n\r\nThis behavious is inconsistent with scipy:\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1614505/75037738-c5ed6900-54ac-11ea-89eb-24896ff3bafd.png)\r\n\r\nCasting the image to float32 acts as a workaround but aligning the behaviour with scipy would be good.\r\n\r\nBelow is some code snippet to ease replicating the problem\r\n```python\r\n%matplotlib inline\r\nimport numpy as np\r\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\r\nfrom PIL import Image\r\nimport requests\r\nurl='https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b7/Normal_axial_T2-weighted_MR_image_of_the_brain.jpg'\r\nim = Image.open(requests.get(url, stream=True).raw)\r\nplt.figure()\r\nplt.imshow(im)\r\n\r\nnp_im = np.array(im)\r\ngrid_x, grid_y = np.meshgrid(np.arange(np_im.shape[1]), np.arange(np_im.shape[0]))\r\ndx = 2*np.random.randn(*np_im.shape[:-1])\r\ndy = 2*np.random.randn(*np_im.shape[:-1])\r\ndef_grid_x = grid_x + dx\r\ndef_grid_y = grid_y + dy\r\n\r\nfrom scipy import ndimage\r\nout_im_r = ndimage.map_coordinates(np_im[:,:,0], [def_grid_y, def_grid_x], order=1)\r\nout_im_g = ndimage.map_coordinates(np_im[:,:,1], [def_grid_y, def_grid_x], order=1)\r\nout_im_b = ndimage.map_coordinates(np_im[:,:,2], [def_grid_y, def_grid_x], order=1)\r\nout_im = np.stack((out_im_r, out_im_g, out_im_b),2)\r\nplt.figure()\r\nplt.imshow(out_im)\r\n\r\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\r\nfrom jax import device_put\r\nfrom jax.scipy import ndimage as jndimage\r\n#uncomment the following line and comment the one after that to use the workaround\r\n#jnp_im = device_put(jnp.float32(np_im))\r\njnp_im = device_put(np_im)\r\njdef_grid_x = device_put(def_grid_x)\r\njdef_grid_y = device_put(def_grid_y)\r\nout_im_r = jndimage.map_coordinates(jnp_im[:,:,0], [jdef_grid_y, jdef_grid_x], order=1)\r\nout_im_g = jndimage.map_coordinates(jnp_im[:,:,1], [jdef_grid_y, jdef_grid_x], order=1)\r\nout_im_b = jndimage.map_coordinates(jnp_im[:,:,2], [jdef_grid_y, jdef_grid_x], order=1)\r\nout_im = jnp.stack((out_im_r, out_im_g, out_im_b),2)\r\nplt.figure()\r\nplt.imshow(jnp.uint8(out_im))\r\n```\r\n","closed_at":"2022-06-24T18:59:47Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":2,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/2281/comments","created_at":"2020-02-21T13:27:03Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/2281/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/2281","id":568954472,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1104782284,"name":"bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTA0NzgyMjg0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/labels/bug"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/2281/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU1Njg5NTQ0NzI=","number":2281,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pinned_comment":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/2281/reactions"},"repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax","state":"closed","state_reason":"completed","sub_issues_summary":{"completed":0,"percent_completed":0,"total":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/2281/timeline","title":"map_coordinates float32 coordinates overflow when input is int8","type":null,"updated_at":"2022-06-24T18:59:47Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/2281","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1614505?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvercaut/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvercaut/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvercaut/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvercaut/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tvercaut","id":1614505,"login":"tvercaut","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ1MDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvercaut/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvercaut/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvercaut/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvercaut/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvercaut/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvercaut","user_view_type":"public"}},"pages":{"comments":[{"page":1,"records":2,"sha256":"d6cb250980c7c93c11f2761d102e196fc3b50b6f603d425db7733781a95a2acb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/2281/comments?per_page=100&page=1"}],"issue":[{"etag":"\"cf1458036b0f99fc49029d0e412483ad86e0fd8f1d0af1cf31455c3a2bba6e7e\"","last_modified":"Sun, 27 Sep 2026 17:18:11 GMT","records":1,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/2281"}],"timeline":[{"page":1,"records":5,"sha256":"85879b375771009d1286948bc1da2ba6a06281530bda509a5b617dd6addb0abf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/2281/timeline?per_page=100&page=1"}]},"record_id":"github-jax-ml-jax-2281","schema_version":"1.0.0","source_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/2281","timeline":[{"actor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1614505?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvercaut/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvercaut/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvercaut/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvercaut/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tvercaut","id":1614505,"login":"tvercaut","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ1MDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvercaut/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvercaut/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvercaut/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvercaut/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvercaut/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvercaut","user_view_type":"public"},"created_at":"2020-02-21T13:40:12Z","event":"cross-referenced","source":{"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1217238?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoyer","id":1217238,"login":"shoyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTcyMzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyer","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1217238?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoyer","id":1217238,"login":"shoyer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTcyMzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyer","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"NONE","body":"This is my first use of JAX some please forgive me if I missed some obvious steps in my experiment. I have been trying to get an idea of the computational performance I could expect by switching from scipy to JAX for `map_coordinates` to currently only achieve worst performance.\r\n\r\nThis is a simple (simplistic?) benchmark I ran on Google Colab with a GPU session:\r\n```python\r\n%matplotlib inline\r\nimport numpy as np\r\nfrom PIL import Image\r\nimport timeit\r\nimport requests\r\nurl='https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b7/Normal_axial_T2-weighted_MR_image_of_the_brain.jpg'\r\nim = Image.open(requests.get(url, stream=True).raw)\r\n\r\nnp_im = np.array(im)\r\ngrid_x, grid_y = np.meshgrid(np.arange(np_im.shape[1]), np.arange(np_im.shape[0]))\r\ndx = 2*np.random.randn(*np_im.shape[:-1])\r\ndy = 2*np.random.randn(*np_im.shape[:-1])\r\ndef_grid_x = grid_x + dx\r\ndef_grid_y = grid_y + dy\r\n\r\nfrom scipy import ndimage\r\nprint('scipy')\r\n%timeit \\\r\nout_im_r = ndimage.map_coordinates(np_im[:,:,0], [def_grid_y, def_grid_x], order=1); \\\r\nout_im_g = ndimage.map_coordinates(np_im[:,:,1], [def_grid_y, def_grid_x], order=1); \\\r\nout_im_b = ndimage.map_coordinates(np_im[:,:,2], [def_grid_y, def_grid_x], order=1); \\\r\nout_im = np.stack((out_im_r, out_im_g, out_im_b),2)\r\n\r\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\r\nfrom jax import device_put\r\nfrom jax.scipy import ndimage as jndimage\r\n#uncomment the following line and comment the one after that to use the workaround\r\n#jnp_im = device_put(jnp.float32(np_im))\r\njnp_im = device_put(np_im)\r\njdef_grid_x = device_put(def_grid_x)\r\njdef_grid_y = device_put(def_grid_y)\r\nprint('\\njax')\r\n%timeit \\\r\nout_im_r = jndimage.map_coordinates(jnp_im[:,:,0], [jdef_grid_y, jdef_grid_x], order=1); \\\r\nout_im_g = jndimage.map_coordinates(jnp_im[:,:,1], [jdef_grid_y, jdef_grid_x], order=1); \\\r\nout_im_b = jndimage.map_coordinates(jnp_im[:,:,2], [jdef_grid_y, jdef_grid_x], order=1); \\\r\nout_im = jnp.stack((out_im_r, out_im_g, out_im_b),2)\r\n\r\nimport torch\r\nimport torch.nn.functional as nnf\r\nprint('\\ntorch with ' + torch.cuda.get_device_name(0))\r\ncuda = torch.device('cuda')\r\ntorch_im = torch.from_numpy(np.float64(np_im)).unsqueeze(0).permute(0,3,1,2).cuda()\r\ngx = 2.0*def_grid_x/(np_im.shape[1]-1)-1.\r\ngy = 2.0*def_grid_y/(np_im.shape[0]-1)-1.\r\ntorch_grid = torch.from_numpy(np.stack((gx,gy),2)).unsqueeze(0).cuda()\r\n%timeit torch_out = nnf.grid_sample(torch_im, torch_grid, mode='bilinear', align_corners=False, padding_mode='reflection').squeeze().permute(1,2,0)\r\n\r\nimport cv2 as cv\r\nprint('\\nopencv cpu')\r\n%timeit out_im = cv.remap(np_im, np.float32(def_grid_x), np.float32(def_grid_y), cv.INTER_LINEAR)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe ouput I get is as such:\r\n```\r\nscipy\r\n10 loops, best of 3: 25.1 ms per loop\r\n\r\njax on device\r\n10 loops, best of 3: 70.7 ms per loop\r\n\r\ntorch with Tesla T4\r\n10000 loops, best of 3: 148 µs per loop\r\n\r\nopencv cpu\r\n1000 loops, best of 3: 1.29 ms per loop\r\n```\r\n\r\nNote that this is vaguely related to #2281 ","closed_at":"2020-02-21T22:34:24Z","comments":1,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/2282/comments","created_at":"2020-02-21T13:40:11Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/2282/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/2282","id":568961272,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/2282/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU1Njg5NjEyNzI=","number":2282,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pinned_comment":null,"reactions":{"+1":1,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":1,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/2282/reactions"},"repository":{"allow_forking":true,"archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/{archive_format}{/ref}","archived":false,"assignees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/assignees{/user}","blobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/git/blobs{/sha}","branches_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/branches{/branch}","clone_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax.git","collaborators_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/collaborators{/collaborator}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/comments{/number}","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/commits{/sha}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/compare/{base}...{head}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/contents/{+path}","contributors_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/contributors","created_at":"2018-10-25T21:25:02Z","default_branch":"main","deploym